Looking for a projector rental in Malaga? A projector is only half the setup, since it needs a screen sized to it and enough lumens to stay legible against your venue's actual lighting, whether that is a darkened conference hall or a bright dealership showroom lit for photography.

Malaga Event Gear never rents a projector without a projection screen: the two are always bundled, delivered, installed and tested by our own crew across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. Pricing is real and published up front, tied to a lumens tier, not a quote only form.

[Book now](/packages/) and get the projector and screen your event actually needs.

