## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear supplies a projector and a bundled projection screen for private parties, executive meetings and corporate presentations across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. Every booking is delivered, installed and tested on site by our own crew, and pricing is real and published, not a quote only form.

Pricing runs from a 50 euro add on to the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), up to a projector and screen bundled into the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) at 295 euros or the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) at 310 euros. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a package to your room and lighting conditions.

## Key Highlights

---

-   A projection screen is never sold on its own: every projector we deploy comes bundled with a screen sized to it.

-   Two real lumens tiers: a 3000 lumen projector on the Basic MICE Pack for standard rooms, and a 5000 lumen laser projector on the Product Presentation Pack for rooms that stay lit.

-   Real euro pricing published up front: +50 euros as an Eco Pack add on, or bundled into the 295 euro Basic MICE Pack and the 310 euro Product Presentation Pack.

-   HDMI and USB-C adapters supplied so your own laptop, tablet or player connects without a last minute cable scramble.

-   Every booking is delivered, installed, tested and collected by our own crew, never a self collect drop off.

## Projector and Screen Pricing by Package

A projector rental at Malaga Event Gear is never an a la carte item: it is either an add on to a social package or a fixed inclusion in a corporate package, and the screen always comes with it. Match your event to the package that already covers it:

| Package | Projector & screen | Brightness | Guest capacity | Price (ex VAT) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) | Projector & projection screen, optional add on (+50 euros) | Not published for the add on | Up to 50 | 290 euros base, +50 euros add on |
| [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) | 2x2m projection screen with a high brightness projector, bundled | 3000 lumens | Up to 40 | 295 euros |
| [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) | Front projection screen with a stable stand, bundled | 5000 lumens, Full HD laser | Not published | 310 euros |

All prices are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown. See live pricing and full inclusions on our [packages page](/packages/).

