## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as early as you can once your event date and venue are confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, and corporate bookings tied to a fixed conference or launch date should lock in the package early rather than wait for a final headcount.

## Conclusion

A projector rental is only as good as its match to your room's lighting: a 3000 lumen tier for a standard boardroom, or a 5000 lumen laser tier for a room that stays lit. From a 50 euro add on on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), up to a bundled screen and projector on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) or the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs, tests and collects the equipment so you never have to. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a package to your event. For our full audio visual rental range, see the [audio visual rental page](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

Planning a product launch instead? See our [audio visual rental for product launches](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-product-launches/) guide, built around the Product Presentation Pack's laser tier. Running a smaller executive meeting? See our [audio visual rental for corporate meetings](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-corporate-meetings/) guide, built around the Basic MICE Pack's boardroom tier. Need a self lit screen instead of a projected image? See our [TV screen rental](/blog/tv-screen-rental/) guide.

## FAQs

### Can I rent just a projection screen, without a projector?

No. We do not sell a projection screen on its own. Every screen we deploy is bundled with a projector sized to it, whether that is the Eco Pack's 50 euro add on or the fixed screen and projector inclusion on the Basic MICE Pack and Product Presentation Pack. See [Why the Screen Is Always Bundled With the Projector](#why-the-screen-is-always-bundled-with-the-projector) above.

### Is a screen included with the projector, or sold separately?

Included, always. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) bundles "projector & projection screen" as one 50 euro add on line. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) includes a 2x2m screen with its 3000 lumen projector. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes a front projection screen with a stable stand alongside its 5000 lumen laser projector. We do not sell either piece on its own.

### What's the largest screen size available?

2x2 meters, on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/). We do not publish a larger a la carte screen size.

### What brightness or lumens do I need for a daylit or brightly lit room?

For a standard boardroom or a room you can dim, the 3000 lumen projector on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) is the right tier. For a room that stays lit, such as a dealership showroom during a launch or a press event with photographers, the 5000 lumen Full HD laser projector on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) is built for that. See [Choosing a Lumens Tier for Your Room](#choosing-a-lumens-tier-for-your-room) above.

### Do you offer 4K or laser projectors?

Laser, yes: the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) uses a 5000 lumen Full HD laser projector. We do not publish 4K resolution on either projector tier we offer.

### Can you project onto a building facade or do outdoor projection mapping?

No. Facade projection and outdoor projection mapping fall outside our current catalog. Our projector and screen setups are built for indoor presentations, conferences and product showcases, not building scale outdoor projection.

### Is setup and installation included?

Yes, on every package. Our crew delivers, installs and tests the projector and screen before your event starts, then returns afterward to collect everything, the same delivery, install, test and collect model we use across our full catalog.

### How much does a projector rental cost?

It depends on the package. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is 290 euros base, plus a 50 euro add on for the projector and screen. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), which bundles the projector and screen as standard, is 295 euros. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), with its 5000 lumen laser projector, is 310 euros. All prices are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. See [Projector and Screen Pricing by Package](#projector-and-screen-pricing-by-package) above.

### How far in advance should I book a projector rental?

Book as early as you can once your event date and venue are confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, and corporate bookings tied to a fixed conference or launch date should lock in early. See [How Far in Advance to Book](#how-far-in-advance-to-book) above.

### Can I connect my own laptop or tablet to the projector?

Yes. On the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), we provide HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces so your own laptop, tablet or media player connects to our screen and sound system without a last minute cable scramble.
